    Lukina</b></size>\r\nArt Director\r\n\r\n<size=36><b>Thi Thanh Nga Pham</b></size>\r\nTechnical
    Artist, VFX Artist, Sound Manager\r\n\r\n<size=36><b>Timur Erdashev</b></size>\r\nGame
    Designer, Programmer, Technical Artist, Audio Implementation, Sound Designer,
    3D Art Support, VFX Artist, Localization Manager, Russian Localization\r\n\r\n\r<size=36><b>Sara
    Miedler</b></size>\r\nTechnical Artist, 3D Artist\n\n\n\r\n<size=60><b>Sound</b></size>\r\n\r\n<size=36><b>Keanu
    Fresen</b></size>\r\nComposer, Sound Designer\r\n\r\n<size=36><b>Luis Kirchlechner</b></size>\r\nComposer,
    Sound Designer\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<size=60><b>Supervisors</b></size>\r\n\r\n<size=36><b>Boris
    Kunkel</b></size>\r\nManagement and Methodology Supervision\r\n\r\n<size=36><b>Ramon
    Schauer</b></size>\r\nArt & Animation Supervision\r\n\r\n<size=36><b>Stephan
    Jacob</b></size>\r\nGame Design Supervision\n\n\n\n<size=60><b>University</b></size>\r\n\r\nProduced
    as part of the Animation & Game Bachelor Program  \r\nat Hochschule Darmstadt
    \u2013 University of Applied Sciences\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<size=60><b>Tools & Assets</b></size>\r\n\r\nUnity
