    Maya\r\nSubstance Painter\r\nProcreate\r\nEZSoftBone\r\nZbrush\nAbleton Live 
    \r\nNuendo\r\n\r\r\nFeel by More Mountains  \r\nFur Brushes by Tim Haag for ZBrush\n\nSnow
    and Ice Shader: Brute Force\n\nVFX assets by KYEOMS, WhiteBox Studio and Hovl
    Studio were used \n\nSome sound effects sourced from\nweloveindies.com and pixabay.com
    and creatively processed\r\n\r\nFonts: Glina Script by Liese Mars and Gabriela
    by Eduardo Tunni \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAll third-party tools and assets used under
